+    $$ C(r) = \begin{cases} \frac{\sum_{x_i \in B} T_i (1 - e^{-\sigma_i \delta_i}) c_i}{\sum_{x_i \in B} T_i (1 - e^{-\sigma_i \delta_i})} & \text{if } \exists x_i \in r \text{ s.t. } x_i \in B \\ 0 & \text{otherwise} \end{cases} $$
